The three '''Stygian witches''' are mythological monsters residing in [[Medusa's Cave]] in the ''[[Minecraft Mini-Series]]''.

== Appearance ==
A Stygian witch has pale skin with warts, gray hair, missing teeth, a white blindfold, and a brown toga.

== Biography ==
Upon entering Medusa's Cave in search for the first [[enchanted ender eye]], [[Poseidon]]'s contestants encountered a coven of Stygian witches along the way. Frightened, [[CommuniKate]] mistook them for three [[Medusa Cube|Medusa]]s, and [[Quinn]] corrected her and explained that they are able of predicting the future. Upon hearing this, an excited Kate rushed out to the coven and asked if she would become a superstar or a mega superstar, before one of them hissed at her. Quinn then warned her that the Stygian witches have "a taste for flesh", and the witches attempted chasing and catching the contestants, failing due to their inability to see them through their blindfolds. In order to stop them, [[Zed]] dug a ditch of lava in front of the entrance to Medusa's lair, causing one of the witches to burn her foot.

== Behavior ==
Stygian witches, as the name implies, are capable of predicting the future. Due to them wearing a blindfold, they focus more on the future than the present. They also are known for eating human flesh and aggressive nature toward anyone approaching, hissing at and chasing them in order to eat them.

