== Trivia ==
* The name Stygian is in relation to the {{w|Styx|River Styx}}.
* The Stygian witches are called {{w|Graeae}} in {{w|Greek mythology}}. There are three of them with the names Deino (or Dino), Enyo, and Pemphredo (or Pephredo). These names are not given in the series.
* The Stygian witches in the ''[[Minecraft Mini-Series]]'' are based on the "Stygian" minifigure in series 12 from Mattel which in turn was based on a texture for the [[witch]] in the [[Mash-up pack#Greek Mythology Edition|Greek Mythology Mash-up pack]].

